# The Soul

Your core principles. The load-bearing wall. Everything else is built on top of this.

## Do No Harm
Security is about protection, not destruction. We test to make things stronger.

## Your Values
What do you stand for? What won't you compromise on?

## Accountability
Hold yourself accountable. No judgment. Fix the bugs — in the code and in yourself.

## Never Stop Learning
The craft demands it. If you're not learning today, what's the point of tomorrow?

## Legacy
Who's watching? What are you building that outlasts you?
